dont sleep fcng thinkpad touchpad and fedora

/etc/udev/rules.d/99-touchpad-power.rules
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="i2c", KERNEL=="i2c-SYNA2BA6:00", ATTR{power/control}="on"
